<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<!--
  OmniArm 7 - OmniSim's generic 7-axis collaborative arm.

  A vendor-neutral reference cobot: 7 revolute joints in the y-along-arm
  convention, 1.515 m shoulder-to-flange span, ~57 kg. It exists so demos,
  tests and tutorials have a redundant-DoF arm to drive without depending on
  any manufacturer's model.

  All geometry is authored in this repository. The visual shells are
  primitive solids emitted by scripts/dev/gen_omnisim_robot_visuals.py;
  collision geometry is primitive cylinders. No mesh, texture or CAD file
  from any third party is used, and nothing here is imported or derived from
  a vendor product model.

  See ../PROVENANCE.md.
-->
<robot name="omniarm7">


